# Breeze Swim branding

When working on **Breeze Swim** branding, marketing, or any customer-facing asset:

- **Business:** Breeze Swim — private swim instruction in Flagler County, FL
- **Focus:** Aquatic survival skills and stroke fundamentals for ages **6 months and up**, **all abilities**
- **Tone:** Warm, reassuring, professional — speak to parents and caregivers with clarity and confidence
- **Logo:** `images/logo.png` — use full-color logo in nav and footer (`.nav-logo`, `.footer-logo`)
- **Colors** (from logo):
  - `breeze-pink` (#fb5b86) — primary accent, CTAs
  - `breeze-coral` (#fc8296) — gradient partner, warm highlights
  - `breeze-sky` / `breeze-teal` / `breeze-water` (#34c0c9) — logo water, links, icons, accents
  - `breeze-deep` (#147a85) — deep teal text and dark sections (no navy)
  - `breeze-gold` (#ffe38d) — tropical accents
  - `breeze-sand` (#dfc0aa) — warm neutrals
  - `breeze-foam` (#fff5f7) — soft backgrounds
- **Typography:** Fredoka for headlines (`.font-display`), DM Sans for body
- **Vibe:** Full tropical — pink, teal, sunset gradients, wave dividers (`.section-wave`), sparkle accents
- **Instructor:** Brielle Goldberg — Academy of Aquatic Survival Training certified; Level 4 Adaptive Swim Whispers certified; Executive Director of WaterSafe Inc.
- **Email:** breezeswimlessons@gmail.com
- **Instagram:** [@breezeswimlessons](https://www.instagram.com/breezeswimlessons/)
- **Facebook:** [facebook.com/breezeswimlessons](https://www.facebook.com/breezeswimlessons)
- **Lesson location:** Private pool in Bunnell — a city in Flagler County, FL
- **Season:** Afternoon lessons, March through October
- **Waitlist:** New families join via Google form — set URL in `js/site-config.js` (`waitlistUrl`). Primary CTA is **Join the Waitlist**, not "Book a Lesson"
- **Lesson format:** **15 minutes** per session, **4× per week** (Monday–Thursday)
- **Program length:** Most students complete a **4–6 week** private program
- **Media files** (AirDrop from iPhone into project):
  - `images/logo.png` — main logo
  - `images/favicon-32.png`, `images/apple-touch-icon.png`, `images/og-image.png`
  - `images/hero.jpg` — homepage hero
  - `images/brielle.jpg` — instructor portrait (About + homepage)
  - `images/pool.jpg` — pool / location
  - `images/gallery-1.jpg` … `gallery-3.jpg` — homepage gallery
  - `videos/clip-1.mp4` … `clip-3.mp4` (or `.mov`) — local lesson clips, OR paste YouTube links in `js/site-config.js`

Do not mix XP Detailing assets, copy, or styling into this project.
